              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi niwe aribabeera Omwanya ogurikwera; kwonka aryabeera amaju ga Israeli gombi eibaare eririkuteeza entsibo n'orukiri orurikugwisa, abeere abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu obusya n'omutego. ",
          "type": "text",
