        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ku baraabagire ngu, muraguze aha barikugambisa emizimu n'aha bafumu, abarikuviigiira, n'abarikuhuhuma, timurikumanya ngu abantu bashemereire kwehanuuza ahari Ruhanga waabo? Nimugira ngu eby'abahuriire bishemereire kwehanuuzibwa aha baafiire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
